# KPI validation

Evidence hierarchy: tools > structured review > LLM narrative.
LLM cannot override Red on security (KPI-01), coverage (KPI-02), or dependency health (KPI-09).
Assess all 12 KPIs or mark N/A with rationale. Verdicts: GO / GO_WITH_CONDITIONS / NO_GO.
